cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "CiteSight"
abstract: >-
  An academic integrity tool for checking student assignments. It extracts
  references and in-text citations, verifies each reference against Crossref,
  Semantic Scholar, and OpenAlex, checks cited URLs, validates citation
  formatting, and flags fabricated, future-dated, or orphaned citations. Ships
  as a desktop application, a command-line tool, and a web service.
type: software
